    <blockquote class="pool-owner-rule">
      <strong>Choose one delivery path</strong>
      Each numbered path is a complete way to reuse connections. Pick the one that matches the programming model and lifecycle owner you want to keep.
      Combining paths adds no capability and makes lifecycle ownership unclear.
    </blockquote>
